# A node that makes a file, and a later node that edits it in place.
# `start` begins a conversation file; `more` adds a message to that same
# file, so the file moves on from the version `start` handed out. A
# seeded run that reuses `start` and runs `more` again is refused: the
# saved output it would send names the file at a version the file is no
# longer at.

start = ChatHistoryAppend { role: "user", text: "one" }
more = ChatHistoryAppend { role: "user", text: "two" }
more.historyFile = start.historyFile
